                                    "body": {
                                        "processed": "<p><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Healthcare</span></p>\n<h1>NeoGenomics Laboratories</h1>\n<p>Rebuilding a complex laboratory ecosystem into a secure, scalable Drupal 10 platform powered by modern architecture, seamless integrations, and HIPAA-compliant performance.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button transparent\" href=\"https://www.neogenomics.com\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"0\">View Website</a></p>\n"
