                                        "__typename": "ParagraphText",
                                        "id": "132",
                                        "verticalAlign": false,
                                        "body": {
                                            "processed": "<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"subhead color-accent\">Success</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\"><span class=\"h3\">Impact</span></p>\n<p class=\"text-align-center\">The project transformed a legacy website into a modern, scalable platform that serves as the trusted source for laboratory test information. By centralizing data, automating synchronization, and improving search, internal teams and customers can reliably access accurate, up-to-date information. The move to a headless architecture, combined with Azure hosting and automated CI/CD pipelines, established a strong technical foundation that supports faster releases, easier maintenance, and future growth.</p>\n"
                                        }
